          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for membership, events, and private sound bath sessions in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg1:#f7efe6; /* warm sand */\\n      --bg2:#efe8df; /* soft clay */\\n      --accent:#8a5a3b; /* warm terracotta */\\n      --muted:#6b5a4a;\\n      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\\n      --card: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);\\n      --maxW:1100px;\\n      --radius:18px;\\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n      color:var(--muted);\\n      background: linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));\\n      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\\n      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;\\n    }\\n    body{margin:0; padding:32px; display:flex; justify-content:center;}\\n    .wrap{width:100%; max-width:var(--maxW);}\\n    header{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:24px; margin-bottom:28px}\\n    .brand{display:flex; gap:16px; align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:12px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffe8d6,#f3d7c7); display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(138,90,59,0.12);}\\n    .logo svg{width:44px;height:44px}\\n    nav{display:flex; gap:14px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted); text-decoration:none; padding:8px 12px; border-radius:10px; font-weight:600}\\n    nav a:hover{background:var(--glass)}\\n    .hero{position:relative; padding:36px; border-radius:var(--radius); background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.85), rgba(255,255,255,0.75)); box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(120,80,60,0.08); overflow:hidden}\\n    .hero .left{max-width:60%}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 6px 0; font-size:28px; color:var(--accent)}\\n    p.lead{margin:0 0 12px 0; font-size:15px; opacity:0.95}\\n    .cta-row{margin-top:12px; display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent); color:white; padding:10px 16px; border-radius:12px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700}\\n    .btn.ghost{background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(138,90,59,0.12); color:var(--accent)}\\n    .card{background:var(--card); padding:18px; border-radius:14px; box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(60,30,20,0.06)}\\n    main{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 420px; gap:26px; margin-top:20px}\\n    .story{padding:22px; border-radius:14px}\\n    h2{margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:20px; color:#5a3f2e}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px; opacity:0.9}\\n    ul.list{padding-left:18px}\\n    .flow{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px}\\n    .flow .step{display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start}\\n    .step .dot{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f6efe7);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(100,50,30,0.06)}\\n    form{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px}\\n    input,textarea,select{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(100,70,60,0.08);font-size:14px}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px; resize:vertical}\\n    .aside{position:relative}\\n    .pattern{position:absolute; inset:0; opacity:0.14; pointer-events:none; background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg'); background-size:420px; background-repeat:repeat; transform:translateY(-20px)}\\n    .offers{display:grid; gap:12px}\\n    .offer-item{padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbf7f4)}\\n    .price-grid{display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:10px}\\n    .pill{background:#f1e6df;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)}\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;font-size:13px;color:rgba(90,70,60,0.7)}\\n    @media (max-width:980px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.hero .left{max-width:100%}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 48 48\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n            <circle cx=\\\"24\\\" cy=\\\"24\\\" r=\\\"22\\\" fill=\\\"#ffe9d9\\\" stroke=\\\"#f3d7c7\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M12 30c6-12 18-12 24 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#8a5a3b\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2.5\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M15 22c4-6 10-6 15 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#b86b49\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.8\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n          </svg>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;opacity:0.85\\\">A sanctuary for sound and presence</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Gather</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Gatherings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">Intimate Sessions</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Memberships</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Our Story</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"faq.html\\\">Notes</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" style=\\\"background:rgba(138,90,59,0.08);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 12px;color:var(--accent)\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"hero-title\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"pattern\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"left\\\">\\n        <h1 id=\\\"hero-title\\\">Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — membership & bespoke sessions</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">If you’ve been called to the sound, we make it easy to join, ask questions, or reserve a private experience. Tell us what you need — membership benefits, corporate sound baths, or a one-on-one restorative session.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve a space</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <section>\\n        <div class=\\\"story card\\\">\\n          <h2>Why reach out?</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">We blend curated instruments with hospitality — think warm textiles, gentle lighting, and layers of harmonic sound. Whether you’re curious about membership or need a tailored private session, we can craft an offering that fits your life.</p>\\n\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">The flow — what to expect</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"flow\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"false\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"dot\\\">1</div>\\n              <div>\\n                <strong>Arrival & settling.</strong> You’ll be welcomed into the space, offered a blanket and bolster. A brief check-in ensures we honor any sensitivities.\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"dot\\\">2</div>\\n              <div>\\n                <strong>Guided transition.</strong> Breath and gentle guidance lead you into the sound bath — soft chime, tuning fork harmonics, and a foundation of crystal bowls or monochord.\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"dot\\\">3</div>\\n              <div>\\n                <strong>Sound immersion.</strong> A 35–50 minute unfurling of textures (gongs, crystal bowls, chimes, kalimba) followed by a quiet integration and tea.\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"dot\\\">4</div>\\n              <div>\\n                <strong>Closing & takeaways.</strong> We re-enter movement slowly, share aftercare suggestions, and open a gentle space for reflection.\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">What to bring</h2>\\n          <ul class=\\\"list\\\">\\n            <li>Comfortable layers, a yoga mat or cushion if you prefer your own, an eye pillow or small scarf.</li>\\n            <li>Water bottle and curiosity — headphones not needed.</li>\\n          </ul>\\n\\n          <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">Contraindications & safety</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">Sound baths are gentle, but please disclose if you are pregnant, have epilepsy, severe tinnitus, or any recent surgeries/traumas. We cannot, in good conscience, recommend intense gong work for those with certain cardiovascular or vestibular conditions — reach out and we will advise alternatives.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\" class=\\\"card offers\\\">\\n          <h2>Membership & offers</h2>\\n          <div class=\\\"offer-item\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <strong>Monthly Membership</strong>\\n                <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Unlimited community sound baths + early RSVP for specials</div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Member Rate</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div class=\\\"price-grid\\\">\\n              <div style=\\\"font-weight:800;font-size:18px\\\">From $49/mo</div>\\n              <div style=\\\"opacity:0.85;margin-left:auto\\\">Includes priority booking</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"offer-item\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <strong>Private & Bespoke</strong>\\n                <div class=\\\"meta\\\">1:1, couples, and corporate offerings crafted to your group</div>\\n              </div>\\n              <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Bespoke</div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;font-size:13px\\\">Request a quote — pricing varies by headcount and travel. Members receive discounted rates.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h2>Testimonials</h2>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:10px\\\">\\n            <blockquote style=\\\"margin:0;padding:12px;border-left:3px solid #f3d7c7;background:#fff8f2;border-radius:8px\\\">\\\"I slept like I hadn't in years — the layers of sound dissolved my busy mind.\\\" <br/><cite style=\\\"font-style:normal;opacity:0.8\\\">— L., {{CITY}}</cite></blockquote>\\n            <blockquote style=\\\"margin:0;padding:12px;border-left:3px solid #f3d7c7;background:#fff8f2;border-radius:8px\\\">\\\"The membership has become my monthly anchor. The facilitators are warm and precise.\\\" <br/><cite style=\\\"font-style:normal;opacity:0.8\\\">— M., {{STATE}}</cite></blockquote>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"aside\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h2>Connect with us</h2>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">We reply within 48 hours. Prefer a phone chat? Call during business hours.</p>\\n          <form action=\\\"/contact\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" aria-label=\\\"Contact form\\\">\\n            <input type=\\\"text\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your full name\\\" required />\\n            <input type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email address\\\" required />\\n            <input type=\\\"tel\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"Phone (optional)\\\" />\\n            <select name=\\\"interest\\\">\\n              <option value=\\\"community\\\">Community Sound Bath</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"membership\\\">Membership</option>\\n              <option value=\\\"private\\\">Private / Corporate</option>\\n            </select>\\n            <label style=\\\"font-size:13px;opacity:0.9\\\"><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"updates\\\"/> I'd like updates on events & new sessions</label>\\n            <textarea name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Brief note about what you're seeking — date preferences, group size, or questions.\\\" ></textarea>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center\\\">\\n              <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send message</button>\\n              <a class=\\\"btn ghost\\\" href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">Call: {{PHONE}}</a>\\n            </div>\\n          </form>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;font-size:13px\\\">\\n            <strong>Email</strong>\\n            <div><a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;font-size:13px\\\">\\n            <strong>Location</strong>\\n            <div>{{VENUE_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h2>Quick pricing glance</h2>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between\\\"><div>Drop-in</div><div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">$28</div></div>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between\\\"><div>Five-pack</div><div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">$120</div></div>\\n            <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between\\\"><div>Membership</div><div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">From $49/mo</div></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n      </aside>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — lovingly held by {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}. Next community gathering: {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;opacity:0.9\\\">Prefer to speak? <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Chunk 4 — contact.html\\n\\nThis bundle contains two files for the sound bath site (layoutFamily=earthy_warm, voice=warm_storyteller, offerModel=membership):\\n\\n- contact.html — the contact page with required sections: hero, story, framework (flow), offers, pricing, testimonials, cta. Includes \\\"what to bring\\\" and contraindications. References assets/img/pattern.svg for the decorative background (unique SVG provided in another chunk). Uses placeholders for: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}, {{VENUE_NAME}}, {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}.\\n\\nNotes:\\n- Navigation labels are intentionally varied (Gather, Gatherings, Intimate Sessions, Memberships, Our Story, Notes, Reserve, Connect) while preserving correct links.\\n- Membership offer language and pricing cues included; private session callouts present.\\n- The contact form posts to /contact and includes membership interest, message, and basic contact fields.\\n- Visual richness is implemented via CSS gradients, shadow, and a patterned SVG background referenced at assets/img/pattern.svg.\\n\\nDo not edit placeholders; they will be replaced by templating logic at build time.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
